  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blue Door Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention of unintended pregnancies and unsafe abortions through the promotion of sexual and reproductive health and rights. The Blue Door fund (BDF) collects unrestricted investments to MSI from a variety of donors, including but not limited to Norad, DFID, Danida, and Global Affairs Canada (GAC), into one central mechanism. Main countries are Nigeria and Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
